{"_ts": 1791616999.4720514, "concerns": [{"id": "coverage-1366fe03", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:SC-001", "text": "No task defines or computes the hypothesis\u2011driven precision bound required by SC\u2011001; the specification expects a measurable bound but the task list lacks any step that establishes or validates it.", "round": 1}, {"id": "coverage-9f02b706", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:SC-002", "text": "SC\u2011002 requires measuring the latency reduction of FastContext\u2011Lite against the baseline latency, yet no task explicitly performs this comparison or records a target reduction.", "round": 1}, {"id": "coverage-fd71c91f", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:SC-003", "text": "SC\u2011003 calls for token\u2011consumption to be measured against the variance observed in the baseline run, but there is no task that computes baseline variance or validates token usage against it.", "round": 1}, {"id": "coverage-c6e8c159", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:SC-005", "text": "SC\u2011005 demands that statistical significance be measured against a (deferred) significance threshold; the task list does not include any step that defines or applies such a threshold.", "round": 1}, {"id": "coverage-cce307c2", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:contracts", "text": "Each contract schema (analysis_schema.schema.yaml, execution_schema.schema.yaml, exploration_log.schema.yaml, repo_metadata.schema.yaml, statistical_summary.schema.yaml) must have at least one associated task (e.g., schema generation, validation, or version\u2011bump). No task references these contracts, leaving them orphaned.", "round": 1}, {"id": "coverage-abeadd8a", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "writing", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:T001", "text": "Tasks T001\u2011T007 are tagged with [US0], but the specification defines only User Stories US\u20111, US\u20112, and US\u20113. The [US0] tag references a non\u2011existent user story and should be removed or renamed.", "round": 1}, {"id": "coverage-f46a20fd", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "writing", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:T002", "text": "Same stale [US0] tag as above.", "round": 1}, {"id": "coverage-433510a8", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "writing", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:T003a", "text": "Same stale [US0] tag as above.", "round": 1}, {"id": "coverage-cba87227", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "writing", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/tasks.md", "location": "tasks.md:T003b", "text": "Same stale [US0] tag as above.", "round": 1}, {"id": "coverage-f1ca0bd5", "reviewer": "coverage", "severity": "writing", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-905-llmxive-follow-up-extending-fastcontext/specs/001-ll